From c1009861bc3402c8bdc32975f08f4d1ce137081a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:57:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(xtask): test scanner ignores braces in strings, chars and
 comments

test_fns counted every brace, so refuse("{", ..) swallowed the next test
and `gate test <next>` found nothing. A small lexer now skips string, raw
string, char literal and // comment content. PROCESS_VERSION 10 -> 11.

Fixes #764

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
